# Obsidian news vault MCP

For **News Intelligence investigation** scratchpad notes, use MCP server **`obsidian-news-vault`** (not `obsidian-vault`).

| Vault | MCP server | Root | Use |
|-------|------------|------|-----|
| News Intelligence newsroom | **`obsidian-news-vault`** | `/mnt/news-intelligence-vault` | Work queue, story briefs, investigation threads |
| General NAS / TTRPG | `obsidian-vault` | `/mnt/obsidian-vault` | Campaign homebrew, personal notes |

## Tools (exact names)

- `vault_resolve_path`, `vault_read_note`, `vault_write_note`, `vault_append_note`, **`vault_delete_note`**
- `vault_search_text`, `vault_list_markdown`, `vault_list_recent`, `vault_list_by_date`

## Rules

- Postgres (`postgres-mcp`) is canonical for facts; vault is workspace only.
- Every note must anchor to `context_id`, `ftm_id`, or `claim_id` where applicable.
- Self-correction: overwrite wrong notes or `vault_delete_note` abandoned drafts.

Setup: `HomeLab-AI-Stack/docs/NEWS_VAULT_AGENT.md` — run `./scripts/sync-agent-mcp.sh` after MCP changes.
